<item><title>Lesotho&apos;s Royal Palace project needs M50 million more to resume</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-s-royal-palace-project-needs-m50-million-more-to-0a1463/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-s-royal-palace-project-needs-m50-million-more-to-0a1463/</guid><category>Lesotho</category><description>The government has earmarked a further M50 million to restart work on the Maseru palace, lifting its projected cost to M461 million.</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 12:43:01 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-s-royal-palace-project-needs-m50-million-more-to-0a1463/share.jpg" length="42065" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ls/lesotho-s-royal-palace-project-needs-m50-million-more-to-0a1463/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
